     "answer": {
      "short": "$\\frac{1}{4}$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Area of square}&=10\\times10=100\\text{ cm}^2\\\\\\text{Area of triangle}&=\\tfrac12\\times10\\times5=25\\text{ cm}^2\\\\\\text{Fraction}&=\\frac{25}{100}=\\frac{1}{4}\\end{align*}$$"
